WEBVTT

00:17.387 --> 00:21.890
I'm in a room, the lights are dim, the monitors a

00:22.050 --> 00:28.874
steady beep I'm waiting for a bed to open, I'm

00:28.975 --> 00:35.607
trying just to sleep Aubrey's on the vinyl couch

00:36.688 --> 00:41.911
She hasn't left my side I'm starving but the

00:42.051 --> 00:48.596
nurse just said My hands are tied Just me again,

00:48.676 --> 00:54.000
it's midnight now Click, the door swings open

00:54.961 --> 00:57.823
Click, the cuff is on his arm

01:01.539 --> 01:08.401
He's just another false alarm He's trying just

01:08.481 --> 01:13.882
to sleep, but he isn't P.O. And I have got a

01:13.982 --> 01:21.284
promise that this night will be so slow It feels

01:21.304 --> 01:29.489
like just a minute I start to drift away A hazy,

01:29.629 --> 01:34.891
anxious, fitful dream That's begging me to stay

01:36.772 --> 01:41.794
But then the sound, it pulls me back The lock upon

01:41.834 --> 01:48.197
the door The squeak of shoes upon the floor I

01:48.277 --> 01:54.399
can't take anymore Just me again, it's 2AM

01:54.900 --> 01:57.821
Click, the door swings open

02:03.748 --> 02:10.072
The light is on him He's just another false alarm

02:10.513 --> 02:17.237
He's trying just to sleep But he isn't P.O. And I

02:17.297 --> 02:22.721
have got a promise That this night will be so slow

02:22.741 --> 02:30.466
I'm not a person, I'm a chart A number on a screen

02:32.753 --> 02:37.335
The most annoying in this night that I have ever

02:37.495 --> 02:41.057
seen

02:41.157 --> 02:46.600
Aubrey's jolting on the sofa She's getting zero

02:46.700 --> 02:53.484
sleep This isn't care, this isn't rest The hole

02:53.524 --> 03:00.007
is way too deep Good morning, it is 6am Click, the

03:00.047 --> 03:01.788
lights are on now

03:06.982 --> 03:12.527
Peep, the new day's dawning He's just another

03:12.727 --> 03:18.873
false alarm He's trying just to eat, but he isn't

03:18.993 --> 03:25.338
P.O. And I have got a promise that this day will be

03:25.498 --> 03:26.720
so slow

03:32.385 --> 03:33.926
Am I still in P.O.? ?

03:37.863 --> 03:38.043
Huh?

03:42.250 --> 03:42.811
Hungry.

